{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Consider a car engine. Without adequate lubrication, moving metal surfaces rub against each other. Friction transfers energy into their internal energy stores, increasing temperature and wasting energy that could otherwise contribute to useful motion. Engine oil reduces friction and therefore reduces this unwanted transfer. It does not eliminate all energy losses, but it can improve efficiency and reduce wear.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 27.192, "words": [["Consider", 0.102083], ["a", 0.570833], ["car", 0.675], ["engine.", 0.961458], ["Without", 2.33075], ["adequate", 2.773458], ["lubrication,", 3.242208], ["moving", 4.257833], ["metal", 4.570333], ["surfaces", 4.869791], ["rub", 5.46875], ["against", 5.651041], ["each", 6.067708], ["other.", 6.210958], ["Friction", 7.421875], ["transfers", 7.942708], ["energy", 8.463541], ["into", 8.958333], ["their", 9.257833], ["internal", 9.453125], ["energy", 9.960958], ["stores,", 10.364583], ["increasing", 11.054708], ["temperature", 11.575541], ["and", 12.278666], ["wasting", 12.473958], ["energy", 12.916666], ["that", 13.372416], ["could", 13.59375], ["otherwise", 13.815125], ["contribute", 14.322916], ["to", 14.804708], ["useful", 14.947916], ["motion.", 15.2995], ["Engine", 16.614583], ["oil", 17.083333], ["reduces", 17.291666], ["friction", 17.8125], ["and", 18.177083], ["therefore", 18.372416], ["reduces", 18.710958], ["this", 19.257833], ["unwanted", 19.492208], ["transfer.", 20.0], ["It", 21.419291], ["does", 21.601583], ["not", 21.783875], ["eliminate", 22.03125], ["all", 22.552083], ["energy", 22.786458], ["losses,", 23.164083], ["but", 23.958333], ["it", 24.140625], ["can", 24.322916], ["improve", 24.466166], ["efficiency", 24.84375], ["and", 25.429708], ["reduce", 25.585958], ["wear.", 25.976583]], "raw": [{"text": "Consider", "start": 0.102083, "end": 0.544791}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.570833, "end": 0.596874}, {"text": "car"